    "text": "Have you chosen an activity for the leisure club day next month?\n\nHave you ever played tennis together?\n\nThe gym has a beginner volleyball session at ten. Its coach says no experience is needed, and the equipment is included.\n\nThere is also an aerobics class at twelve, followed by yoga at two. Both are indoors, so the weather will not matter.\n\nSix dollars for each person. The center asks visitors to book by Thursday, because the room is small.\n\nYes, and please wear a helmet. You can leave the bikes next to the front door. There is also a place to jog or hike in the park afterward.\n\nYes. The first game begins at four. You can be a spectator without paying, and the coach will explain the score.\n\nThe winner gets a small cup, but nobody has to be a champion to join the morning sessions.",
